    <body>
      <div type="clause" n="6">
        <head><ref type="lawCode" target="law:Hu">Hu</ref> 6</head>
        <ab type="selectedText" xml:lang="und">Gyf hwá riht forbuge ⁊ uthleape, forgylde þæt angylde se ðe hine to ðam hearme geheold.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en">If anyone evades the law and escapes, he who has supported him in wrongdoing shall pay the damage.</ab>
        <ab type="supplementaryText" xml:lang="und">Si quis rectum declinet uel aufugiat, persoluat uno gildo (angildum) qui eum ad dampnum illud tenuit.</ab>
      </div>
